Test-only adaptation for 06-validate-video-plane-extents.patch. The production
video-plane extent validation fix has already been submitted upstream:
https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/work_items/5395

Use 2x4 ALTERNATE video info for buffers containing one 2x2 field, so the
RGB comparison helper matches the tested interlaced format. Preserve the
production video-plane extent validation.

This test adaptation itself has not been submitted upstream.

--- a/tests/check/elements/videoconvert.c
+++ b/tests/check/elements/videoconvert.c
@@ -199,7 +199,8 @@
 }
 
